stale_copy.description:
Besides `{expected}`, another folder under custom_components contains Frieda (manifest domain `friedafetch`): {paths}

Home Assistant matches custom integrations by their manifest domain, not by folder name, so this copy can silently replace the current installation (currently loaded from `{loaded}`). It is usually a leftover `icloud_mcp` folder from before the rename.

Delete the folder(s) listed above and restart Home Assistant.
